><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this simulation game, you have 90 days to guide the heroine down a path of corruption. Each day is divided into four time slots: morning, afternoon, evening, and midnight. During each time slot, you can choose different actions such as working part-time to earn money, interacting with Chiho, or purchasing items. The game also features a variety of mini-games that help boost intimacy and advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/26f3bb02ab602966d7ea328c800bfa60.avif?t=1766030618\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/509a5c205352596f390cb0b52c3d06a1.poster.avif?t=1766030618\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/509a5c205352596f390cb0b52c3d06a1.webm?t=1766030618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/509a5c205352596f390cb0b52c3d06a1.mp4?t=1766030618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/a6d2f0acc5cabf6b0eadb78c6423e3a2.poster.avif?t=1766030618\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/a6d2f0acc5cabf6b0eadb78c6423e3a2.webm?t=1766030618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/a6d2f0acc5cabf6b0eadb78c6423e3a2.mp4?t=1766030618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/458ab18539e0857593eaaa6219168603.poster.avif?t=1766030618\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/458ab18539e0857593eaaa6219168603.webm?t=1766030618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/458ab18539e0857593eaaa6219168603.mp4?t=1766030618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work part-time, you can earn money to purchase powerful items that help advance the story. For example, the Spy Cam allows you to peek into the room of the newlywed couple next door, while the Ninja Scroll unlocks special gameplay features. As Chiho's corruption energy continues to accumulate, players can unlock more Devil Skills, leading to new interactions and story developments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/cfa1047ba9e75ab3ed66047b2a715a50.avif?t=1766030618\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras_big/cfa1047ba9e75ab3ed66047b2a715a50.webp?t=1766030618 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/ab55145d78c902436ea311b4cd1806f9.avif?t=1766030618\" width=800 height=2773 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/e4d2e0fdaafc9c6e7145d9d3669bb133.avif?t=1766030618\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span 